<span id="A1.T4.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Notifies events that are consequences of agent actions, analogous to mobile notifications. <span id="A1.T4.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Default in Gaia2.</span></span>
