<span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:227.6pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">All <span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">medium</span> tools plus: 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Shopping:</span> <span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">add_product</span>, <span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">add_item_to_product</span>, <span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">add_discount_code</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">RentAFlat:</span> <span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">add_new_apartment</span> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cabs:</span> <span id="A1.T4.2.4.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">update_ride_status</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Notifies all environment events, including those independent of agent actions (e.g., new products).</span>
</span></td></tr>
